Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:08:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/17] AI-only MageZero port onto upstream XMage

MageZero's AI, encoder, MCTS, RL and runner modules, with only the engine hooks
they need (decision history, MCTS anchor/checkpoints, entity names, flags), all
additive. Their copy-on-write engine and rules shortcuts are left out; their
performance hooks get plain full-copy stand-ins.
